try to emulate me.

00:22:31.917 --> 00:22:33.375
And the reason I
continue to put out,

00:22:33.375 --> 00:22:35.542
now, I want to talk
about what I think is

00:22:35.542 --> 00:22:37.667
the way I do it so
people can use me as a blueprint

00:22:37.667 --> 00:22:39.041
for themselves.

00:22:39.041 --> 00:22:40.333
But the reason every

00:22:40.333 --> 00:22:43.083
two weeks, three weeks,
four weeks, I'll say something

00:22:43.083 --> 00:22:44.792
that throws them off,

00:22:44.792 --> 00:22:46.041
