and this is what works for me.

00:22:49.208 --> 00:22:50.375
I'm the reverse.

00:22:50.375 --> 00:22:51.333
Something that, you know,

00:22:51.333 --> 00:22:52.750
I'm sure DRock's
laughing right now.

