00:23:02.542 --> 00:23:05.208
Like I need the
light to see your faces.

00:23:05.208 --> 00:23:06.917
I need the stimulation.

00:23:06.917 --> 00:23:09.166
I suffocate in silence.

00:23:09.166 --> 00:23:11.083
Of course when I'm
exhausted, these guys

00:23:11.083 --> 00:23:13.542
picked me up last night, we
flew from New York to Ireland.

00:23:13.542 --> 00:23:17.125
One-hour nap, all day Ireland,
flight, they picked me up.

00:23:17.125 --> 00:23:18.417
I had to get mentally ready.

00:23:18.417 --> 00:23:19.959
I wanted to catch up
with him but I was kinda like,

00:23:19.959 --> 00:23:22.959
I needed a little bit of
silence, sometimes I need it.

00:23:22.959 --> 00:23:27.125
But 99% of the time,
when I'm awake,

00:23:27.125 --> 00:23:28.250
I need action.

00:23:29.542 --> 00:23:30.375
You know?

00:23:30.375 --> 00:23:32.625
And so,

00:23:32.625 --> 00:23:34.000
but you have to understand,

00:23:34.000 --> 00:23:35.875
and I think we're
going to connect on this.

00:23:35.875 --> 00:23:38.625
I'm only
comfortable and at peace

00:23:38.625 --> 00:23:39.708
in the chaos.

00:23:42.166 --> 00:23:44.000
When I get silence,

00:23:44.000 --> 00:23:46.500
I get sad, I get anxious.

00:23:46.500 --> 00:23:48.750
It's not interesting to me,
so I think the key here is

00:23:48.750 --> 00:23:51.166
to just know yourself,
and not try to map to,

00:23:51.166 --> 00:23:52.333
oh this person.

00:23:52.333 --> 00:23:56.250
One of the biggest reasons
I go after Steve Jobs's legacy

00:23:56.250 --> 00:23:59.583
is because I want to build the
biggest company in the world,

00:23:59.583 --> 00:24:02.125
