00:24:16.375 --> 00:24:17.875
Fuck that.

00:24:17.875 --> 00:24:20.708
I think you get much more
out of honey than vinegar.

00:24:20.708 --> 00:24:21.917
Much more from people.

00:24:21.917 --> 00:24:22.875
So,

00:24:22.875 --> 00:24:25.500
