00:57:15.125 --> 00:57:16.083
- Fifteen, one five?
- [William] Fifteen,

00:57:16.083 --> 00:57:19.458
not fifty, let's
hope we get there.

00:57:19.458 --> 00:57:20.458
Influencers...
- Yes.

00:57:20.458 --> 00:57:22.083
