you see the difference,

00:57:26.083 --> 00:57:28.041
and how to go
about really practical,

00:57:28.041 --> 00:57:31.208
how to go about in getting
those on board in the company?

00:57:31.208 --> 00:57:32.417
- I think we're
talking about the same thing,

00:57:32.417 --> 00:57:34.500
the difference is five
years ago, they had blogs

00:57:34.500 --> 00:57:38.083
