made a faster horse."

00:58:26.542 --> 00:58:30.375
Cool, go be
Henry Ford, you know?

00:58:30.375 --> 00:58:32.208
Back to my young man over here,

00:58:32.208 --> 00:58:35.625
like, there's four
Facebooks, Facebook, Snapchat,

00:58:35.625 --> 00:58:38.750
like, everybody's
going and reverse engineering

00:58:38.750 --> 00:58:40.625
all time, all time stuff.

00:58:40.625 --> 00:58:44.750
We lack practicality.
There's only two options.

00:58:44.750 --> 00:58:46.875
That's business,
not this bullshit

00:58:46.875 --> 00:58:48.792
that venture capital, give me,

00:58:48.792 --> 00:58:52.000
I mean 98%
of startups in America

00:58:52.000 --> 00:58:54.834
