is exactly when they need

00:59:08.542 --> 00:59:11.917
to get practical
and change everything,

00:59:11.917 --> 00:59:13.166
and make sure
they're not burning money

00:59:13.166 --> 00:59:15.166
but making money,
so when it goes this,

00:59:15.166 --> 00:59:16.667
then they pick up everything.

00:59:16.667 --> 00:59:19.667
I built two businesses,
both during crashes,

00:59:19.667 --> 00:59:22.458
I came into Wine Library when
the stock market crashed,

00:59:22.458 --> 00:59:24.417
and 9/11 happened
and all my customers lived

00:59:24.417 --> 00:59:27.417
