Built a huge business.

00:59:27.417 --> 00:59:30.125
I started VaynerMedia
in the financial crisis

00:59:30.125 --> 00:59:33.000
of 2008 and 2009 in America.

00:59:33.000 --> 00:59:36.375
I'm a wartime general.
That's a true entrepreneur.

00:59:36.375 --> 00:59:39.625
Not when idiots
are giving you funding.

00:59:41.625 --> 00:59:45.959
How much talent does it take
to lose money every month?

00:59:47.875 --> 00:59:50.542
I think we can all do it.

00:59:50.542 --> 00:59:52.000
- [Sophie] Hi Gary, I'm Sophie.

00:59:52.000 --> 00:59:53.917
Nice to meet you.
- Nice to meet you.

