01:00:05.542 --> 01:00:07.834
- [Sophie] And we also
have the younger agencies,

01:00:07.834 --> 01:00:10.041
who are really
digital, digital natives.

01:00:10.041 --> 01:00:10.750
- Yes.

01:00:10.750 --> 01:00:12.708
- [Sophie] And who are
really performance based.

01:00:12.708 --> 01:00:13.250
- Yes.

01:00:13.250 --> 01:00:16.834
- [Sophie] But I feel that
in those agency, the really,

01:00:16.834 --> 01:00:21.041
the smart marketing,
essence that we used--

01:00:21.041 --> 01:00:22.667
- Like strategy and
creative lax, right?

01:00:22.667 --> 01:00:24.250
The same
happened with my company.

01:00:24.250 --> 01:00:25.875
- [Sophie] The
first ones, they have the,

01:00:25.875 --> 01:00:28.667
the real, the great creative
directors and everything,

01:00:28.667 --> 01:00:31.750
and the smaller ones,
the young ones, they don't,

01:00:31.750 --> 01:00:34.041
but there is this mismatch.
- [Gary] Correct.

01:00:34.041 --> 01:00:36.041
- [Sophie] And as a client,
we now need both of them.

01:00:36.041 --> 01:00:36.792
- [Gary] Yes.

01:00:36.792 --> 01:00:38.834
- [Sophie] So how is, how
is this now in the States?

01:00:38.834 --> 01:00:40.875
- The big ones are
gonna get disrupted,

01:00:40.875 --> 01:00:42.500
