the upstart that survived,

01:00:48.250 --> 01:00:50.917
and make €130,
then that one will have it,

01:00:50.917 --> 01:00:53.750
then they'll get big, and then
Martin Sorrell will buy 'em.

01:00:53.750 --> 01:00:56.333
- [Sophie] Okey-doke.
Alright, thank you.

01:00:56.333 --> 01:00:57.542
- So what your
job is as a client,

