01:02:44.375 --> 01:02:47.333
I said this the other
day with DRock, I'm like,

01:02:47.333 --> 01:02:50.500
"I hate this question,
because I have no respect,

01:02:50.500 --> 01:02:53.333
"or time, or
energy for my failures,

01:02:53.333 --> 01:02:55.250
"and so I don't
think about them as much."

01:02:55.250 --> 01:02:58.625
I think, I mean
there's a lot, look,

01:02:58.625 --> 01:03:00.834
my first book was
called "Crush It!",

01:03:00.834 --> 01:03:02.542
and in the acknowledgements,
if you go get it

01:03:02.542 --> 01:03:05.041
