unless they do it your way.

01:07:30.208 --> 01:07:32.083
- [Sebastian] Thanks
that makes sense.

01:07:32.083 --> 01:07:34.417
- It's, it makes sense,
it's the right answer

01:07:34.417 --> 01:07:37.542
